<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`第七章 AOP。先说切面是什么：实现了 Aspect 接口的 @Bean。

Aspect 接口有六个方法。before 最先执行；around 包住原函数体，由你决定什么时候调 point；after 在 around 之后执行；throwing 处理异常；final 最后一定执行；proceed 是把这几个方法串起来的默认实现，你也可以覆盖它自己编排。

默认 proceed 的顺序是：try 里面先 before，再 around，around 里调原函数体，然后 after；任何一步抛异常都进 catch 里的 throwing；finally 里的 final 一定会执行。

要点是：before、around、原函数体、after 这四步里任意一步抛异常都会进 throwing，而 final 无论成功失败都会跑。

如果你有更特别的编排需求，直接覆盖 proceed 自己排就行——这也是为什么 proceed 会在接口里。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 7 章 · AOP f_aspect · 7.1</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>切面 = 实现了 Aspect 的 @Bean</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>面试与实战都爱问</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 266, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 10 }}>public interface Aspect</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func before(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo): Unit              // 最先"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func around(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo, point: (Array<Any>) -> Any): Any"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func after(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo, result: Any): Any   // around 之后"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func throwing(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo, e: Exception): Exception"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func final(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo): Unit               // 最后"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func proceed(funcInfo: InvocationFuncInfo, point: (Array<Any>) -> Any): Any"}</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>默认 proceed 的顺序</Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>before</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#38BDF8' }}>→</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8' }}>around</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#38BDF8' }}>→</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>原函数体（point(...)）</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#38BDF8' }}>→</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>after</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#38BDF8' }}>→</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #F59E0B', padding: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F59E0B' }}>final</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 16 }}>前面四步任意一步抛异常 → 进 catch 走 throwing；finally 里的 final 一定会执行。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 6 }}>有更特别的编排需求，直接覆盖 proceed 自己排。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>42 / 116</Text>
